      "side": 1,
      "message": "We previously did this, but for WebSSO pointing to specific Identity Providers, it can be a security vulnerability if you use wild cards. I believe using wild cards is less of a security risk if you only have one Identity Provider to route to. But in the case where you have multiple Identity Providers, by using a wild card, you could end up at Coke\u0027s IdP when you really meant to go to Pepsi\u0027s.",
